@startuml http_session_event_stream
title CampusClaw Session Event Direct POST Stream

' Source evidence (pi-mono 5cd93f688aaab89dbb6dfa4aca535f21796ae185):
' packages/agent/src/types.ts, AgentEvent.
' packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts, tool execution events and ToolResult messages.
' packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts, _checkCompaction and _runAutoCompaction.
' packages/coding-agent/src/core/compaction/compaction.ts, estimateContextTokens,
' prepareCompaction, compact, and generateSummaryWithUsage.
' packages/ai/src/utils/overflow.ts, isContextOverflow and isRecoverableLength.
' Source evidence (pi-mono-java PR 167 f60cc3e78bb8b700527ac082c7c8e10524ede095):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventService.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventProjector.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/session/ManagedAgentSession.java.
' Observed behavior: PR 167 has a request-scoped SSE execution and durable message entries,
' but it does not retain compaction or expose durable configuration-change events.
' Architecture change: model reconciliation happens before accepting a User Entry.
' Architecture change: Assistant and compaction completions persist Usage and update lifetime Usage.
' Security hardening: tool delta omits arguments and is best-effort; dropping it never fails a tool.
' Design reason: keep transient progress separate from the durable history and recovery boundary.
' Java divergence: Runtime database Entries replace pi JSONL compaction entries.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  ActorBorderColor #475569
  ActorFontColor #0F172A
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
  GroupBorderColor #64748B
  GroupFontColor #334155
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #C2410C
  FontColor #7C2D12
}

actor Caller
participant "Session Event\nAPI" as API
participant "Model\nReconciler" as Reconciler
database "Runtime Session\nStore" as Store
participant "ManagedAgentSession" as Session
participant "Best-effort\nEvent Buffer" as Buffer

Caller -> API : POST /sessions/{sessionId}/events\nmessage or fileIds JSON
API -> Store : load idle Session
Store --> API : current configuration and lifetimeUsage
API -> Reconciler : reconcile latest Agent directory

alt current model is invalid and a usable default exists
  Reconciler -> Store : atomically append model.changed\nand optional thinking.changed
  Store --> API : updated configuration entries
  API --> Caller : durable configuration events\nbefore user.message
else no usable default exists
  Reconciler --> API : model unavailable
  API --> Caller : reject before SSE and User Entry
else current model remains valid
  Reconciler --> API : unchanged
end

API -> Store : persist User Entry and mark running
Store --> API : entryId and entrySeq
API --> Caller : user.message
API -> Session : prompt(user message)

loop each Assistant message
  Session --> API : message start and deltas
  API --> Caller : assistant.message.started and deltas
  opt thinking snapshot is true
    Session --> API : thinking start, deltas, and completion
    API -> Store : persist allowed completed thinking
    API --> Caller : thinking lifecycle events
  end
  Session --> API : completed message with Usage
  API -> Store : persist Assistant and atomically add lifetimeUsage
  API --> Caller : assistant.message.completed with Usage

  opt tool call
    Session --> API : tool execution started
    API --> Caller : tool.execution.started
    loop tool progress
      Session --> Buffer : toolCallId, toolName, delta
      Buffer --> Caller : tool.execution.delta if serializable and writable
    end
    Session --> API : tool completed and final result
    API -> Store : persist ToolResult Entry
    API --> Caller : tool.execution.completed and tool.result
  end
end

opt prepared threshold, overflow, or manual compaction
  Session --> API : compaction.started after safe window exists
  API --> Caller : session.compaction.started
  alt structured summary succeeds
    Session --> API : full summary, first kept boundary, tokens, Usage
    API -> Store : persist compaction and atomically add lifetimeUsage
    API --> Caller : session.compaction.completed
    opt ERROR or LENGTH overflow and first recovery
      Session -> Session : exclude failed Assistant and retry model once
    else successful STOP overflow
      Session -> Session : preserve answer; do not replay model call
    end
  else summary fails or is cancelled
    Session --> API : old context preserved, aborted flag
    API --> Caller : session.compaction.failed\nreason, willRetry, aborted, message
  end
end

Session --> API : execution complete
API -> Store : clear active execution
API --> Caller : session.status.idle and stream.end

note over Buffer,Caller
Tool delta has no arguments and is never persisted.
Serialization, size, or backpressure failure drops only progress.
The final ToolResult remains authoritative.
end note

note over Session,Store
Compaction completion stores the full summary and retained boundary.
Failure never publishes a partial context and never deletes history.
Only ERROR or LENGTH overflow can retry the model call once.
A second overflow emits failure and is never retried again.
No safe prepared window means no compaction lifecycle event.
end note
@enduml

@startuml http_session_event_list
title CampusClaw Public History and Model Recovery Projections

' Source evidence (pi-mono 5cd93f688aaab89dbb6dfa4aca535f21796ae185):
' packages/coding-agent/src/core/session-manager.ts, SessionEntry and getBranch.
' packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts, model, thinking, and compaction entries.
' Source evidence (pi-mono-java PR 167 f60cc3e78bb8b700527ac082c7c8e10524ede095):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventQueryService.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEntryCodec.java.
' Observed behavior: PR 167 reads one durable branch for public history and execution restoration.
' Architecture change: the same entries feed two explicit projections with different consumers.
' Design reason: audit events belong in public history but must not become synthetic model messages.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

database "Append-only current-branch Entries" as Entries
rectangle "Public history projection" as Public
rectangle "GET /sessions/{sessionId}/events" as GetEvents
rectangle "Model recovery projection" as Recovery
rectangle "ManagedAgentSession context" as Context

Entries --> Public : messages, ToolResult, model/thinking changes,\ncompaction completed, allowed thinking
Public --> GetEvents : entrySeq order and opaque page

Entries --> Recovery : messages and ToolResult after latest boundary,\nplus latest complete compaction summary
Recovery --> Context : model-ready messages only

note right of Public
Started, delta, failed, idle, end, and stream error
events are transient and never enter GET history.
end note

note right of Recovery
Model and thinking changes are audit facts.
They are not converted to User or Assistant messages.
Entries hidden behind compaction remain durable history.
end note
@enduml
